[[63,1,0,"<h2>CENTRE REAR COURTESY LIGHT</h2><p>The rear courtesy light is located in the end section of the roof. It contains three lamps, one centre and two side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2930.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>A - Front view</li><li>B - Rear view</li><li>1 - Left xenon bulb (spot) (6W)</li><li>2 - Halogen centre bulb (spot) (10W)</li><li>3 - Right xenon bulb (spot) (6W)</li><li>4 - Button for activating left light</li><li>5 - Button for activating right light</li><li>6 - Connector.</li></ul></figure>"]]